    {
      "url": "/illustrations/",
      "title": "Illustrations",
      "description": [
        "My love for children resulted in the publication of three children\u2019s books. My illustrated books include \"Babri,\" which received distinction by The Society of Children's Writers and Illustrators. \"The Monkey Bridge,\" was selected as one of the 30 books exhibited at Norman Rockwell Museum. My most recent book, \"The Prince Who Ran Away,\" was published by Knopf, and is taught at some elementary schools."
